      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "#VIOLET#*Before you stands Berethh. His face shows no emotion, but his posture is threatening.#LAST#\n",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#VIOLET#*在你的面前站着的是贝里斯。他面无表情，只是摆出了攻击的姿势。#LAST#\n",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "7af2e6455a9d605e0ef7c2fc1d8eec8e6200c731830ff59af6bcd7128665c9e2"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "0ca45797e4090d7aaee90909ed4ecdf77e0117c130b3cd611b0cc889159899ab",
      "line": 5245,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "Kyless is dead.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "克里斯死了。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "0ca45797e4090d7aaee90909ed4ecdf77e0117c130b3cd611b0cc889159899ab"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "53bcef9442bd43645dde5b837ee6d2f709a88473dbd7e8caedb12aa051c20d19",
      "line": 5246,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "I'm not sure if you deserved your fate. Still I cannot let you live.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我不知道你是否该死。不管怎样，我要杀了你。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "53bcef9442bd43645dde5b837ee6d2f709a88473dbd7e8caedb12aa051c20d19"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "e4620e0a2f481a681977166a3f095a879d22674854fd29defa2d6b86cc3b720b",
      "line": 5247,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "Then you will die like Kyless. #LIGHT_GREEN#[Attack]#LAST#",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "那么你就会像克里斯一样死掉。#LIGHT_GREEN#[攻击]#LAST#",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "e4620e0a2f481a681977166a3f095a879d22674854fd29defa2d6b86cc3b720b"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "76ee5256f2103cfc6d450c1c05517434700852d9d47659023e4393832b5c04e9",
      "line": 5248,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "I need your help. I want to overcome my curse.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我需要你的帮助。我想要克服我的诅咒。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "76ee5256f2103cfc6d450c1c05517434700852d9d47659023e4393832b5c04e9"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "d0931f0fd5e2d6e8ca99cd67628802996c134020a12827132b5b0262394e72cf",
      "line": 5249,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua",
      "source": "I do not want to kill you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我不想杀你。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "d0931f0fd5e2d6e8ca99cd67628802996c134020a12827132b5b0262394e72cf"
    },
    {
